00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.350
Hey, what are you making her do?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.550
You really want her to draw such dangerous pic...

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:24.050
Yes, indeed.

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:25.950
I want it.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.290
Ruins?

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:31.660
Pyramid?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.230
What now?

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.570
Me again?

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.270
Corpse = Mummy
Want = Corpse
I want to... Corpse...

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:45.910
So mummy, huh?
Want = Corpse
Corpse = Mummy

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:49.310
Stop doing weird things.
Just interpret it normally!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.510
Gokyoya, what will you do?

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:53.520
Right then.

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:56.050
How about a physical checkup?

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:59.550
Oh, we're going to play doctor?
You're going to strip?

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:00.920
Just you.

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:03.790
That's just a normal checkup.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:06.590
I want to become a doctor after all.

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.060
I'm totally healthy.

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:10.870
People like that have the most risk.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:14.700
It's common where the body is young, but the inside is old.

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:18.740
How about an intensive checkup at a hospital?

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:21.680
Intensive checkup? I don't need it.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.550
What?

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.590
Like I said, why me too?

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:36.320
Checkup = Human dock = Human dog

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:40.600
"Dock" and "dog" are similar, but this is wrong.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:41.960
I'll destroy you.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.030
What's wrong, Tayune?

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:48.270
How about playing Frisbee?

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:51.010
That's just a sport. No.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:54.080
How dare you. Frisbee is fun.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:57.280
If I catch what's thrown,
Master Kaoru gets happy.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:59.450
You're the one catching it?

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.550
If you've got no idea,
I'll give you one.

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:07.120
Right then, how about kissing me?

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:10.760
I can't believe it.
You idiot, cheater...

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.930
Now then Tayune, shall we kiss?

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:18.800
The one where it's deep and passionate.

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:30.710
Kiss = Kisu = Silago fish

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:33.180
Not that. Kiss. Like on the lips.

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:37.290
Stop being stubborn and do it right.
Or I'll really break you.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:42.590
I'll let Igusa pass.

00:17:42.590 --> 00:17:43.990
You're lying.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:46.460
I'm not into forcing...

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:49.900
No, I'm sure you'll sink your poisonous fangs into me.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:52.900
You'll threaten me so I can't fight back.

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.640
Then you'll strip my clothes one by one,

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:59.110
and tie me up to make turtle patterns.

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.940
And use a device I dare not say.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:05.680
Master Kaoru, save me.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:08.180
Hang on. What do you think I am?

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:09.720
Don't come closer.

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:12.090
No. Pervert!

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.670
I see.

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:27.040
You said pervert, and that's why I showed up.

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:29.970
Hey, what the heck is this?

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:31.640
Why me too?

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:36.410
Karina's fine, but why is it not a pun and me of all people?

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.150
You should care.
Let go of me, Kawahira.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.680
No, I can't let go.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:43.590
You get away from me.

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:46.450
I want to, but I can't.

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:49.760
So Master Keita has that kind of hobby.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:51.560
Very shocking!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:52.290
Pervert.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:55.400
So Karina is the bottom.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:56.830
That's nice.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.770
No, don't be mistaken.

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:01.240
There's nothing between us. I swear.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:04.040
I don't have this kind of hobby either.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:06.410
This is some sort of accident.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.540
This isn't getting anywhere.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.650
It was a mistake to trust Master Keita.

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:14.050
Let's decide it ourselves.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:15.820
How?

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:18.690
Of course...

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:20.560
By force.

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:25.060
Stop it!

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:30.830
Good grief. I came by to look, and look at this.

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.840
Stop this embarrassing act.

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:35.840
- But...
- Be quiet.

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.510
I heard about it.

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:42.840
You were arguing about ranks?

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:44.210
Yeah.

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:46.350
We were told
Master Keita should decide.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:48.220
Even so.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:52.050
Master Kaoru doesn't want to see us fight each other.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:58.060
Surely Master Kaoru wants us to get along.

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:01.100
Even so, are you still going to fight?

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:06.830
If you understand, stop fussing over the ranks.

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:07.840
Okay.

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:11.140
All right. You all understand.

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:14.540
Girls shouldn't fight over ranks after all.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.310
It was worth playing a villain.

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:18.580
Right, Karina?

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:19.910
Yeah.

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:23.280
I don't really get it, but it's good to stop fighting.

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:25.290
Happily ever after.

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:30.060
Now let's make a paradise with no ranks where everyone's equal.

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:35.360
Keita, you're still saying that?

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:38.500
Who do you think caused all this fuss?

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.030
Wait, Yoko.

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:42.740
This is my once in a lifetime chance.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.470
No more talking.

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.440
Evil Blaze!

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:51.750
Why me too?

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:56.050
Oh my, my prediction turned out to be true.

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:57.520
You reap what you sow.

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:02.860
But why did Master Kaoru choose Master Keita to decide?

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:04.190
That's...

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:07.960
Master Kaoru likes Master Keita.

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:13.100
I see.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:43.130
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:48.540
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:53.680
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:58.880
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:02.080
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:04.620
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:07.320
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.760
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.660
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:16.400
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.110
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.770
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:35.650
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:38.390
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:41.960
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:54.100
Inukami!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.040
See you!

